1
00:00:46,413 --> 00:00:47,781
<i>It's just that he was a loner.</i>

2
00:00:48,615 --> 00:00:50,383
<i>He was always by himself.</i>

3
00:00:52,218 --> 00:00:54,821
<i>Never anyone to share
a game with.</i>

4
00:00:56,790 --> 00:00:58,725
<i>A man who lived in dreams.</i>

5
00:01:00,160 --> 00:01:01,628
<i>That's who he was.</i>

6
00:01:06,499 --> 00:01:07,434
Spike.

7
00:01:07,700 --> 00:01:09,202
Time to go.

8
00:01:09,736 --> 00:01:10,904
Wake up!!

9
00:01:18,578 --> 00:01:20,013
<i>Think about it, girl.</i>

10
00:01:21,414 --> 00:01:23,116
You know what it looks like?
